# ============================================================
# .gitignore  —  Cyberbullying Detection thesis project
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 1) PRIVACY — files that contain personal data (phone numbers,
#    student IDs). These are internal supervisor/department
#    documents, not meant for a public repository.
#    Delete a line below if you deliberately want to include it.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
Meeting_Schedule_Form.*
Meeting_Schedule_Filled.*
Decision_Log.*
Cyberbulling_Thesis_Review.*
Thesis_Review.*
Thesis_Changes_Oct2026.*

# Internal planning / handoff notes (context only — not for public)
prompt/
*handoff*
*prompt*.md

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 2) DATASET — raw self-collected comments scraped from
#    YouTube/Reddit/Facebook may breach platform terms and can
#    contain personal info. Do NOT publish the raw data.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
Dataset/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 3) LaTeX build / auxiliary files (never commit these)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.xdv

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 4) Python / Jupyter
# ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 5) OS / editor junk
# ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
.*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 6) OPTIONAL — uncomment to also keep the full thesis source
#    private until grading is finished (avoids plagiarism-checker
#    matching your own public repo).
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Thesis_CyberBullying_FINAL.zip
# Thesis Report/thesis_preview.pdf
